OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABadenoch says she is instructing
OL,4,Alawyers to challenge government after
OL,5,ATory-run council's 94% tax hike
OL,6,
OL,7,FBadenoch said the Conservative Party
OL,8,Fhad "instructed lawyers" to see if an
OL,9,F#84m-a-year government funding cut,
OL,10,Fwhich Wandsworth Council has blamed for
OL,11,Fthe increase, can be blocked.
OL,13,FThe government has insisted it needs to
OL,14,Freform the "outdated" council funding
OL,15,Fsystem to move money to where it is
OL,16,Fmost needed.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
